  "description": {
    "zh": "真实的雨天玻璃：细密水雾、大小不一的圆水珠，以及会缓慢下滑的长条雨滴和拖尾。分布、密度、大小、长条比例、拖尾长度各自独立，带色散、高光与边缘光。",
    "en": "Rain on a window: fine mist, round beads of mixed sizes, and slow sliding streaks with trails. Independent density, size, streak ratio, trail length, plus dispersion, highlights and rim light."
